{
    "_comment": "The developer's stats (AppStatsPanel), two parts each shown by its own setting and the panel while either is on: with Display Stats (stats-box) the frame rate, the GPS fix, and how firmly the device stands in the dimension map - a SignalIndicator filled and coloured by MapTracker::strength's level, pulsing at every fix, the map's state beside it and the numbers under it; with Display Localize Timing (live-box) what stands between the camera button and the content (LiveViewTimeline): the headline - how long Live View has waited and for what, or when the content came - the tiles and the localizer, the requests waiting for the network, and the breakdown of every stage passed with its time and its share.",
    "name": "stats-panel",
    "visible": false,
    "type": "Window",
    "panel": true,
    "receiveInput": false,
    "style": {
        "positionType": "absolute",
        "left": 10,
        "top": 60,
        "paddingLeft": 10,
        "flexDirection": "column",
        "gap": 10,
        "backgroundColor": [0, 0, 0, 0]
     },
    "children": [
        {
            "name": "stats-box",
            "style": {
                "flexDirection": "column",
                "gap": 10
            },
            "children": [
                {
                    "name": "fps-text",
                    "type": "Text",
                    "text": "9999"
                },
                {
                    "name": "gps-text",
                    "type": "Text",
                    "text": "GPS -"
                },
                {
                    "name": "map-row",
                    "style": {
                        "flexDirection": "row",
